{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53581","headline":"咏廿四气诗 立夏四月节 · 元稹","name":"咏廿四气诗 立夏四月节","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲知春与夏，仲[吕]（侣）啓朱明。\n蚯蚓谁教出，王苽自合生。\n帘（一作「簇」）蚕呈蠒样，林鸟哺雏声。\n渐觉云峰好，徐徐带雨行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53581.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53581","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}